 2轮）：\n• 弹力带足背屈：每侧12次\n• 脚趾支撑：30秒
 \n• 脚趾换：15次\n• 弓步脚踝伸展：每侧45秒\n• 胫骨
 前肌勾脚：15次\n• 弹力带臀推：12次\n• 弹力带侧向走
 ：每个方向12步\n• 侧弓步：每侧8次\n• 哥萨克蹲或高
 脚杯深蹲：每侧6次\n• 单腿硬拉：每条腿8次\n• 提膝：
 每条腿10次\n\n晚上柔术：\n• 技术练习和轻松对练\n• 
 回家后可选：再做一轮脚踝和臀部小课\n\n—— English —
 —\nTime: 85 min\nPre-run activation (5 min):\n• Band lateral walk: 10 
 steps each way\n• Bodyweight squat: 15\n• Band RDL: 15\n• Glute brid
 ge: 10\n\nRun (easy 12 km):\n• Pace: 5:50–6:20\n• HR: under 155\n\nA
 nkle and glute mini-session after the run (15 min\, 2 rounds):\n• Band d
 orsiflexion: 12/side\n• Tiptoe hold: 30 s\n• Toe switches: 15\n• Lun
 ge ankle stretch: 45 s/side\n• Tibialis raise: 15\n• Banded hip thrust
 : 12\n• Banded lateral walk: 12 steps each way\n• Lateral lunge: 8/sid
 e\n• Cossack or goblet squat: 6/side\n• Single-leg RDL: 8/leg\n• Kne
 e drive: 10/leg\n\nBJJ in the evening:\n• Drilling and light rolls\n• 
 Optional at home afterwards: one more round of the ankle and glute mini-se
 ssion\n\nhttps://andyxuedct.github.io/Training-Plan/
URL:https://andyxuedct.github.io/Training-Plan/
