 ：2 x 15\n8. 过顶绳索臂屈伸 🏅 + 弯举：2 x 12，交替做\n\n
 今天不做（明天测5公里）：\n• 引体向上第2天\n• 借力
 推举、高翻接火箭推\n• 核心循环\n\n—— English ——\nTi
 me: 45 min\nSwim (15 min\, first):\n• About 400 m easy: 8 x 50 m\n• 20
  s rest\n\nOptional upper body (30 min\, 2 sets\, 3 reps in reserve\, noth
 ing heavy):\n1. Flat DB press: 2 x 10\, 90 s rest\n2. Machine chest press 
 🏅: 2 x 10\, 90 s rest\n3. Seated cable row: 2 x 12\, 90 s rest\n4. Pec 
 deck: 2 x 15\, 60 s rest\n5. Half-kneeling single-arm pulldown: 2 x 10 eac
 h\, 60 s rest\n6. Seated DB shoulder press: 2 x 10\, 90 s rest\n7. Face pu
 ll: 2 x 15\n8. Overhead rope extension 🏅 + curl: 2 x 12\, alternating\n
 \nSkip today (5K check tomorrow):\n• Pull-up Day 2\n• Push press\, cle
 an into thruster\n• Core circuit\n\nhttps://andyxuedct.github.io/Trainin
 g-Plan/
