 nTime: 45 min\nPre-run activation (5 min):\n• Band lateral walk: 10 step
 s each way\n• Bodyweight squat: 15\n• Band RDL: 15\n• Glute bridge: 
 10\n\nRun (5K check):\n• Warm-up: 3 km easy + 4 strides\n• Test: 5 km 
 hard\n• Pacing: first 2 km at 4:05\, then speed up if you can\n• Targe
 t: 20:00–20:30\n• Cool-down: 2 km easy\n• Send me the time and I'll 
