  to press: 2 x 8 each\, 60 s rest\n6. Leg extension\, seat reclined: 2 x 1
 2\n7. Standing barbell calf raise: 2 x 10\n\nSkip today: deadlift and Nord
 ics\n\nFunctional (10 min): wall balls EMOM 8 min\, 15 per minute\n\nEveni
 ng (optional\, 10 min):\n• World's greatest stretch: 5/side\n• 90/90 h
 ip switches: 8/side\n• Prone neck series on a yoga block\n\nhttps://andy
 xuedct.github.io/Training-Plan/
